    <section class="case-section case-section--alt" aria-labelledby="challenges-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="case-section__title reveal" id="challenges-title">Challenges Faced</h2>
        <div class="case-grid reveal">
          <div class="case-grid__card glass">
            <span class="case-grid__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <span data-icon="zap" class="icon icon--sm"></span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="case-grid__card-title">True RMS Current</h3>
            <p class="case-grid__card-text">Sampling ≥1 full mains cycle so AC magnitude does not collapse to DC bias.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="case-grid__card glass">
            <span class="case-grid__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <span data-icon="git-branch" class="icon icon--sm"></span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="case-grid__card-title">Train vs Alert Labels</h3>
            <p class="case-grid__card-text">Keeping fixed training bands independent of adaptive live thresholds to avoid leakage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="case-grid__card glass">
            <span class="case-grid__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <span data-icon="brain" class="icon icon--sm"></span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="case-grid__card-title">Small-Class GNB Variance</h3>
            <p class="case-grid__card-text">Variance shrinkage toward the pooled distribution so rare critical rows stay well-behaved.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="case-grid__card glass">
            <span class="case-grid__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <span data-icon="lock" class="icon icon--sm"></span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="case-grid__card-title">TLS on ESP32</h3>
            <p class="case-grid__card-text">CA-verified HTTPS to Render (GTS Root R4 + ISRG X1) instead of setInsecure().</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="lessons-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="case-section__title reveal" id="lessons-title">Lessons Learned</h2>
        <p class="case-section__text reveal">
          Edge ML is as much about sensing honesty and label hygiene as it is about model
          choice. Separating live alert thresholds from training labels kept the dataset
          usable while still letting Settings adapt the rule engine. Confidence-weighted
          ensembles need explicit floors — otherwise a overconfident tiny GNB class can
          drown out safer rules.
        </p>
        <p class="case-section__text reveal">
          SoftAP UX and cloud sync are complementary: phones join the device network for
          setup and live charts, while OS push and model refit require a real HTTPS host.
          Designing both paths up front avoided painting the project into a SoftAP-only corner.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

